    "promptSnippet": "# Aster Component Implementation Prompt — Slider\n\n## 1. Component Purpose & Canonical Role\n- **Component:** Slider (`slider`)\n- **Category:** Form Controls\n- **Native Element:** `<input type=\"range\">`\n- **Summary:** Lets people pick a value from a range by dragging.\n- **When to Use:** Resource thresholds, capacity percentages, audio/display levels.\n- **When Not to Use:** Exact arbitrary numbers where typing is faster (use Input type=\"number\").\n\n## 2. Authoritative Repository Files\n- **Component CSS:** `components/slider/slider.css`\n- **Component Spec:** `docs/components/slider.md`\n- **Agent Contract:** `skills/using-aster-components/SKILL.md`\n- **Compiled Bundle:** `dist/css/aster.css` and `dist/js/aster.js`\n\n## 3. Canonical HTML Structure & Classes\n```html\n<div class=\"as-slider-field\">\n  <div class=\"as-slider-field__header\">\n    <label class=\"as-slider-field__label\" for=\"mem-slider\">Memory Limit</label>\n    <span class=\"as-slider-field__value\">75%</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"as-slider-box\">\n    <input type=\"range\" class=\"as-slider\" id=\"mem-slider\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" value=\"75\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 4. Measured Geometry\nMeasured from the rendered component when this page loads.\n\n## 5. Non-Negotiable Aster Constraints\n1. **Zero Primitive Color Leaks:** Bind colors strictly to `--as-semantic-color-*` custom properties. Never use `--as-color-primitive-*` or hardcoded hex values in component usage.\n2. **Minimum 4px Radius Policy:** Never use `2px` border-radius. Use `--as-radius-sm` (`4px`), `--as-radius-md` (`8px`), `--as-radius-lg` (`12px`), or `--as-radius-full` (`9999px`).\n3. **Single Standard Density Mode:** Compact mode (`data-density=\"compact\"` / `.as-*--compact`) is permanently retired. Do not emit compact classes or attributes.\n4. **WCAG 2.2 AA Accessibility:** Maintain >= 4.5:1 text contrast, >= 3:1 UI/border contrast, >= 24x24px interactive hit targets, and full keyboard operability (`Tab`, `Enter`, `Space`, `Escape`, Arrow keys).\n\n## 6. Verification Commands\n```bash\nnpm run test:components\nnpm run test:contrast\nnpm run test:browser\n```",
    "tokensHtml": "<!-- Canonical Token Bindings -->\n<section class=\"doc-section\"><h2>Tokens</h2><p>Values update with the current theme.</p><div class=\"spec-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Slider tokens\"><table class=\"spec-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Role</th><th scope=\"col\">Token</th><th scope=\"col\">Current value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Filled Track</td><td><code>--as-semantic-color-interactive-primary</code></td><td data-resolve=\"--as-semantic-color-interactive-primary\" data-kind=\"color\"></td></tr><tr><td>Unfilled Track</td><td><code>--as-semantic-color-surface-muted</code></td><td data-resolve=\"--as-semantic-color-surface-muted\" data-kind=\"color\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>",
