    "promptSnippet": "# Aster Component Implementation Prompt — Progress\n\n## 1. Component Purpose & Canonical Role\n- **Component:** Progress (`progress`)\n- **Category:** Data Display\n- **Native Element:** `<div role=\"progressbar\">`\n- **Summary:** Shows how far along a task is.\n- **When to Use:** Migrations, uploads, snapshots, and multi-step jobs.\n- **When Not to Use:** Inline button loading states (use Button spinner).\n\n## 2. Authoritative Repository Files\n- **Component CSS:** `components/progress/progress.css`\n- **Component Spec:** `docs/components/progress.md`\n- **Agent Contract:** `skills/using-aster-components/SKILL.md`\n- **Compiled Bundle:** `dist/css/aster.css` and `dist/js/aster.js`\n\n## 3. Canonical HTML Structure & Classes\n```html\n<!-- Determinate Progress -->\n<div class=\"as-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"68\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-label=\"Compression\">\n  <span class=\"as-progress__bar\" style=\"width: 68%;\"></span>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Indeterminate Progress -->\n<div class=\"as-progress as-progress--indeterminate\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Syncing\">\n  <span class=\"as-progress__bar\"></span>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 4. Measured Geometry\nMeasured from the rendered component when this page loads.\n\n## 5. Non-Negotiable Aster Constraints\n1. **Zero Primitive Color Leaks:** Bind colors strictly to `--as-semantic-color-*` custom properties. Never use `--as-color-primitive-*` or hardcoded hex values in component usage.\n2. **Minimum 4px Radius Policy:** Never use `2px` border-radius. Use `--as-radius-sm` (`4px`), `--as-radius-md` (`8px`), `--as-radius-lg` (`12px`), or `--as-radius-full` (`9999px`).\n3. **Single Standard Density Mode:** Compact mode (`data-density=\"compact\"` / `.as-*--compact`) is permanently retired. Do not emit compact classes or attributes.\n4. **WCAG 2.2 AA Accessibility:** Maintain >= 4.5:1 text contrast, >= 3:1 UI/border contrast, >= 24x24px interactive hit targets, and full keyboard operability (`Tab`, `Enter`, `Space`, `Escape`, Arrow keys).\n\n## 6. Verification Commands\n```bash\nnpm run test:components\nnpm run test:contrast\nnpm run test:browser\n```",
    "tokensHtml": "<!-- Canonical Token Bindings -->\n<section class=\"doc-section\"><h2>Tokens</h2><p>Values update with the current theme.</p><div class=\"spec-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Progress tokens\"><table class=\"spec-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Role</th><th scope=\"col\">Token</th><th scope=\"col\">Current value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fill Bar</td><td><code>--as-semantic-color-interactive-primary</code></td><td data-resolve=\"--as-semantic-color-interactive-primary\" data-kind=\"color\"></td></tr><tr><td>Track Surface</td><td><code>--as-semantic-color-surface-muted</code></td><td data-resolve=\"--as-semantic-color-surface-muted\" data-kind=\"color\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>",
    "a11yHtml": "<!-- Accessibility Specifications -->\n        <section class=\"doc-section\">\n          <h2>Accessibility &amp; Keyboard Interaction</h2>\n          <p>Requirements for using this component accessibly, following the W3C ARIA Authoring Practices Guide.</p>\n          <div class=\"spec-wrap\">\n            <table class=\"spec-table\">\n              <thead><tr><th>Interaction / Key</th><th>Behavior &amp; Compliance Requirement</th></tr></thead>\n              <tbody>\n\n      <tr><td>Progressbar Role</td><td>Declares <code>role=\"progressbar\"</code> and accessible label.</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Reduced Motion</td><td>Indeterminate animation collapses to static bar under reduced motion.</td></tr>\n\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </section>"
