    "previewHtml": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: var(--as-space-5); align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">\n        <div class=\"as-tooltip-trigger\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"as-button as-button--secondary\">\n            <span class=\"as-button__label\">Snapshot Volume</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"as-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Instant cryptographic volume snapshot</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"as-tooltip-trigger\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"as-button as-button--ghost\">\n            <span class=\"as-button__label\">Help Guide</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"as-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">View automated failover documentation</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
    "codeSnippet": "<div class=\"as-tooltip-trigger\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"as-button as-button--secondary\" aria-describedby=\"tip-snap\">\n    <span class=\"as-button__label\">Snapshot Volume</span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"as-tooltip\" id=\"tip-snap\" role=\"tooltip\">\n    Instant cryptographic volume snapshot\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "promptSnippet": "# Aster Component Implementation Prompt — Tooltip\n\n## 1. Component Purpose & Canonical Role\n- **Component:** Tooltip (`tooltip`)\n- **Category:** Feedback & Status\n- **Native Element:** `<div role=\"tooltip\">`\n- **Summary:** A short hint shown on hover or keyboard focus.\n- **When to Use:** Clarifying icon buttons or terse technical abbreviations.\n- **When Not to Use:** Interactive content or buttons inside the floating panel (use Popover).\n\n## 2. Authoritative Repository Files\n- **Component CSS:** `components/tooltip/tooltip.css`\n- **Component Spec:** `docs/components/tooltip.md`\n- **Agent Contract:** `skills/using-aster-components/SKILL.md`\n- **Compiled Bundle:** `dist/css/aster.css` and `dist/js/aster.js`\n\n## 3. Canonical HTML Structure & Classes\n```html\n<div class=\"as-tooltip-trigger\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"as-button as-button--secondary\" aria-describedby=\"tip-snap\">\n    <span class=\"as-button__label\">Snapshot Volume</span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"as-tooltip\" id=\"tip-snap\" role=\"tooltip\">\n    Instant cryptographic volume snapshot\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 4. Measured Geometry\nMeasured from the rendered component when this page loads.\n\n## 5. Non-Negotiable Aster Constraints\n1. **Zero Primitive Color Leaks:** Bind colors strictly to `--as-semantic-color-*` custom properties. Never use `--as-color-primitive-*` or hardcoded hex values in component usage.\n2. **Minimum 4px Radius Policy:** Never use `2px` border-radius. Use `--as-radius-sm` (`4px`), `--as-radius-md` (`8px`), `--as-radius-lg` (`12px`), or `--as-radius-full` (`9999px`).\n3. **Single Standard Density Mode:** Compact mode (`data-density=\"compact\"` / `.as-*--compact`) is permanently retired. Do not emit compact classes or attributes.\n4. **WCAG 2.2 AA Accessibility:** Maintain >= 4.5:1 text contrast, >= 3:1 UI/border contrast, >= 24x24px interactive hit targets, and full keyboard operability (`Tab`, `Enter`, `Space`, `Escape`, Arrow keys).\n\n## 6. Verification Commands\n```bash\nnpm run test:components\nnpm run test:contrast\nnpm run test:browser\n```",
    "tokensHtml": "<!-- Canonical Token Bindings -->\n<section class=\"doc-section\"><h2>Tokens</h2><p>Values update with the current theme.</p><div class=\"spec-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Tooltip tokens\"><table class=\"spec-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Role</th><th scope=\"col\">Token</th><th scope=\"col\">Current value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Background</td><td><code>--as-semantic-color-text-default</code></td><td data-resolve=\"--as-semantic-color-text-default\" data-kind=\"color\"></td></tr><tr><td>Corner Radius</td><td><code>--as-radius-sm</code></td><td data-resolve=\"--as-radius-sm\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>",
