    "promptSnippet": "# Aster Component Implementation Prompt — Avatar\n\n## 1. Component Purpose & Canonical Role\n- **Component:** Avatar (`avatar`)\n- **Category:** Data Display\n- **Native Element:** `<span role=\"img\">`\n- **Summary:** A circular picture or initials for a person or team, with an optional status dot.\n- **When to Use:** Showing who a person or team is, in lists, comments, and headers.\n- **When Not to Use:** Generic icons or logos with no person or team behind them.\n\n## 2. Authoritative Repository Files\n- **Component CSS:** `components/avatar/avatar.css`\n- **Component Spec:** `docs/components/avatar.md`\n- **Agent Contract:** `skills/using-aster-components/SKILL.md`\n- **Compiled Bundle:** `dist/css/aster.css`\n\n## 3. Canonical HTML Structure & Classes\n```html\n<span class=\"as-avatar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Maya Chen, online\">\n  MC\n  <span class=\"as-avatar__status\"></span>\n</span>\n\n<span class=\"as-avatar as-avatar--lg\">\n  <img class=\"as-avatar__image\" src=\"/maya.jpg\" alt=\"Maya Chen\">\n</span>\n```\n\n## 4. Measured Geometry\nMeasured from the rendered component when this page loads.\n\n## 5. Non-Negotiable Aster Constraints\n1. Bind colors to `--as-semantic-color-*` tokens, never primitives or hex values.\n2. Use the radius tokens, with 4px as the smallest component radius.\n3. Aster has one standard density, with no compact mode.\n4. Keep text at 4.5:1 contrast and interactive elements keyboard operable.\n\n## 6. Verification Commands\n```bash\nnpm run test:components\nnpm run test:browser\n```",
